[{"answer":"Can I help you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I've just moved to this area with my wife and children","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/2.mp3"},{"answer":"and I'd like to know where we can all register with a doctor at a Health Centre.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, there's Doctor Green at The Harvey Clinic.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/5.mp3"},{"answer":"We always recommend her for babies, because she's very good with them and she runs a special clinic.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh... actually my youngest child is five, so that wouldn't be any good for us.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Is there anywhere else I could try?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, the Eshcol Health Practice is the next one on my list.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/10.mp3"},{"answer":"How do you spell that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/11.mp3"},{"answer":"ESHCOL.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/12.mp3"},{"answer":"And it's Doctor Fuller, who has space on his list.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/13.mp3"},{"answer":"The clinic only opened a year ago, so the facilities are all very modern.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/14.mp3"},{"answer":"That sounds good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/15.mp3"},{"answer":"And it's particularly good if you're busy during the day,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/16.mp3"},{"answer":"because they also do appointments in the evening.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/17.mp3"},{"answer":"They're closed on Saturday, though.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/18.mp3"},{"answer":"The only other place on the list is the Health Centre on Shore Lane.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/19.mp3"},{"answer":"You can register with Doctor Gormley,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/20.mp3"},{"answer":"that's GORMLEY.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/21.mp3"},{"answer":"He's new there, but the centre has a very good reputation.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh yes, I think I know the road.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/23.mp3"},{"answer":"That would be the best one.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Could you tell me, will all their services be free?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Erm... there are usually some small charges that doctors make.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Let me see what it says about the Shore Lane Centre.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/28.mp3"},{"answer":"If you need to be vaccinated before any trips abroad, you won't have to pay for this.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Erm, what else?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/30.mp3"},{"answer":"The sports injury treatment service operates on a paying basis,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/31.mp3"},{"answer":"as does the nutritional therapy service.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Some health centres do offer alternative therapies like homeopathy as part of their pay-to-use service.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Shore Lane are hoping to do this soon.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/34.mp3"},{"answer":"I think they may start with acupuncture.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/35.mp3"},{"answer":"And finally, if you need to prove you're healthy","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/36.mp3"},{"answer":"or haven't had any serious injuries before a new employer will accept you,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/37.mp3"},{"answer":"you can get a free fitness check-up there,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/38.mp3"},{"answer":"but you'd most likely have to pay for insurance medicals though.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/40.mp3"},{"answer":"You might also be interested to know the Centre is running a pilot scheme of talks for patients.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/41.mp3"},{"answer":"I've got the list here.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Actually, they look very interesting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/43.mp3"},{"answer":"What sort of things?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, the first one's about giving up smoking.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/45.mp3"},{"answer":"It's next week, the twenty-fifth of February, at 7 pm,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/46.mp3"},{"answer":"and that's in Room 4.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/47.mp3"},{"answer":"It says, the talk will stress the health benefits, particularly for people with asthma or heart disease.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/48.mp3"},{"answer":"That sounds very interesting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/49.mp3"},{"answer":"There's also a talk for families with children.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/50.mp3"},{"answer":"It's on Healthy Eating, and takes place on the first of March at five o'clock.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Will that be at the Health Centre?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/52.mp3"},{"answer":"Erm, actually it's at the primary school on Shore Lane.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/53.mp3"},{"answer":"I imagine they're inviting the parents of pupils there - it says here 'all welcome'.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/54.mp3"},{"answer":"I might go to that if I have time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/55.mp3"},{"answer":"There's a couple of other talks -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/56.mp3"},{"answer":"one giving advice about how to avoid injuries while doing exercise.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/57.mp3"},{"answer":"It's on the ninth of March.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, it's a late afternoon talk, at 4:30","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/59.mp3"},{"answer":"and it'll be in Room 6.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/60.mp3"},{"answer":"It also says the talk is suitable for all ages.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/61.mp3"},{"answer":"And finally, there's a talk called 'Stress Management'...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-4-part-1-2023-07-24-14-48-55/62.mp3"}]
